#: welcomebrowser.cpp:79
msgid "Welcome to amaroK!"
msgstr "amaroK плейерига марҳамат!"

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:80
msgid ""
"There are many media players around these days, this is true; but, what is "
"missing from most players, is an interface that does not get in the way of "
"the user. How many buttons do you have to press when simply adding media to "
"the playlist? amaroK tries to be a little different, providing a simple "
"drag-and-drop interface that makes playlist handling really easy."
msgstr ""

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:81
msgid "Customise your amaroK"
msgstr "Плейерни сиз истагандек мосланг"

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:82
msgid ""
"amaroK has two main modes of operation. It can look and act a little like "
"XMMS and other Winamp clones, or it can have a single window with a "
"statusbar to keep you up to date with the track progress. You can switch "
"between them using the following links:"
msgstr ""

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:84
msgid "Switch to XMMS-mode"
msgstr "XMMS усулига ўтиш"

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:85
msgid "Switch to Compact-mode"
msgstr "Ихчам усулига ўтиш"

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:88
msgid "Using amaroK"
msgstr "Плейердан фойдаланиш"

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:89
msgid ""
"amaroK is all about easy playlist building. This welcome text is embedded in "
"a tab in the BrowserBar; each tab in the bar is a route to your music and "
"media: open the browsers by clicking the tabs and then drag media from the "
"listings to the playlist. The different browsers are as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:91
msgid "File Browser"
msgstr "Файл браузери"

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:91
msgid ""
"The FileBrowser will be the most useful browser to people at first; use it "
"to navigate your filesystem to where you keep your music and then "
"drag-and-drop to the playlist. Filtering by <EM>*.mp3 *.ogg</EM> may prove "
"useful to you."
msgstr ""

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:92
msgid "Search Browser"
msgstr "Қидириш браузери"

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:92
msgid ""
"Some people have too much music to remember where it all is. The Search "
"Browser makes it easy to find lost tracks: specify a search term (e.g. "
"'Chem' to find all your <EM>Chemical Brothers</EM>"
" music), specify a path to start the search in, and click "
"<STRONG>Search</STRONG>. You can even drag-and-drop the files to Konqueror "
"afterwards if you want to move them all to a sensible location so you do not "
"need to search again next time."
msgstr ""

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:93
msgid "Collection Browser"
msgstr "Тўплам браузери"

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:93
msgid ""
"This is amaroK's lightning-fast music database. Assemble the database and "
"enjoy the benefits of fast, categorised music sorting."
msgstr ""

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:94
msgid "Context Browser"
msgstr "Статистика браузери"

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:94
msgid "Statistics, context, brilliance."
msgstr ""

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:95
msgid "Stream Browser"
msgstr "Оқим браузери"

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:95
msgid ""
"Internet radio is a fabulous way to find out about new music without "
"upsetting the various record industries of the world. Fetch the streams from "
"the online meta-server and drag-and-drop something to suit your tastes. You "
"can even submit your own favorite radio stations to the server to increase "
"the choice for everyone else."
msgstr ""

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:98
msgid "To remove this tab from the BrowserBar,"
msgstr ""
"Браузер панелидан ушбу табни олиб ташлаш "
"учун "

#: welcomebrowser.cpp:98
msgid "click here"
msgstr "бу ерни босинг"

